  "_about": "Non-E-number ingredients. Each pattern is a plain phrase matched on word boundaries; the longest matching phrase wins. 'generic' entries are class names like 'emulsifier' and are used only when the label gives no specific additive. upf=true marks NOVA-4 industrial ingredients.",

